        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/df788c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-08T19:45:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>My copy of OblivAeon hasn't arrived yet (or has arrived and the guy who organised the group backing is abroad so it can't be picked up yet) but I'm looking to update&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1T9QRc84ae4ZkgKvlghS-Jwe2cLrKcJ-YT3IWZDGjvhw/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this spreadsheet</a>&nbsp;that I have for Super Scientific Tachyon's Experiment power. To that end I'm looking for someone to count keywords on cards in the five OblivAeon heroes decks (Luminary, La Comodora, Lifeline, Akash'Thriya and The Harpy). For example, Tachyon would look like this:</p><ul>\n<li>19 One-Shot, Burst</li>\n<li>10 One-Shot</li>\n<li>3 Ongoing, Burst</li>\n<li>3 Ongoing, Limited</li>\n<li>3 Equipment, Limited</li>\n<li>2 Ongoing</li>\n</ul><p>Thanks to anyone who helps out in advance!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:39.859Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
