        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>My copy of OblivAeon hasn&#39;t arrived yet (or has arrived and the guy who organised the group backing is abroad so it can&#39;t be picked up yet) but I&#39;m looking to update&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1T9QRc84ae4ZkgKvlghS-Jwe2cLrKcJ-YT3IWZDGjvhw/edit?usp=sharing\">this spreadsheet</a>&nbsp;that I have for Super Scientific Tachyon&#39;s Experiment power. To that end I&#39;m looking for someone to count keywords on cards in the five OblivAeon heroes decks (Luminary, La Comodora, Lifeline, Akash&#39;Thriya and The Harpy). For example, Tachyon would look like this:</p><ul><li>19 One-Shot, Burst</li><li>10 One-Shot</li><li>3 Ongoing, Burst</li><li>3 Ongoing, Limited</li><li>3 Equipment, Limited</li><li>2 Ongoing</li></ul><p>Thanks to anyone who helps out in advance!</p>",
